      "why": "Recorded for context only. The authenticated role is a signed in staff member whose access is scoped by RLS and by checkUserPermission, and the list grows with every ordinary staff table, so freezing it would produce noise rather than signal. anon is the boundary that matters because it needs no credential at all."
    }
  },
